{"parse":{"title":"特性/灾翼虫巢暴君","pageid":8183,"revid":20179,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E8%99%AB%E5%B7%A2%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%9B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E8%99%AB%E5%B7%A2%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%9B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E8%99%AB%E5%B7%A2%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%9B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>灾翼虫巢暴君</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.81.BE.E7.BF.BC.E8.99.AB.E5.B7.A2.E6.9A.B4.E5.90.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"灾翼虫巢暴君\"><b>灾翼虫巢暴君</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 冰原裂齿猪.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/23/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />灾翼虫巢暴君\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强韧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强韧</font></span></span>]、受到百分比伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">95%</font>。<br />✦拥有落水救星，触发时损失<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>生命值。<br />✦免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">控制</font></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×不屈</font></span></span>]、传送、打断。<br />✦被施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">受到伤害提高类减益</span>]时，最大效果不超过<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。<br />✦受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]时，消耗自身<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>生命值，将其移除。<br />✦战斗开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">12</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：免疫所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"属性减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">属性减益</font></span></span>]。每层提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">300</font>点防御，最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">6%</font>。<br />✦每回合结束时移除<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层，最少剩余<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">百分比伤害</span>]降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>。<br />✦被击败时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">70%</font>生命，驱散所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，且攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦玩家可多次击败首领以获得更多积分，即使被击败也不会战斗失败。<br />✦触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">不屈</font></span></span>]时，回复全部能量，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">再动机会</span>]时额外增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层。<br />✦战斗回合结束时，每层剩余的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">再动机会</span>]转化为<font color=\"#58cb48\">2</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E8%99%AB%E5%B7%A2%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%9B\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/灾翼虫巢暴君\"><img alt=\"灾翼虫巢暴君 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/83/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png/75px-%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E8%99%AB%E5%B7%A2%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%9B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/83/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png/113px-%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E8%99%AB%E5%B7%A2%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%9B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/83/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164230\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.104 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.152 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1122/1000000\nPo